      "content": "it's hard to remember the beginning when the ending feels so much more real. everything i started with feels like it was just part of a dream i woke up from. now i'm just standing here, looking at the horizon, and it feels like the most honest thing i can do is just accept that the journey is over. there's a kind of peace in realizing that you don't have to keep fighting the elements anymore. it's almost like... it's the only way to actually be still.",
